  <data name="ChordDataLicense" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Chord suggestion order will be improved using data tallied from a larger set of songs (about 660,000 songs).

The dataset &quot;Chordonomicon&quot; (S. Kantarelis et al., 2024) will be downloaded from Hugging Face (about 260 MB). Only the chord transition counts are tallied and saved on this PC; the downloaded original data is not saved.

This dataset is provided under the CC BY-NC 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial) license. The tallied data follows the same license and may only be used for non-commercial purposes.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.en
https://huggingface.co/datasets/ailsntua/Chordonomicon

Do you agree to the license and download it?</value>
